WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.838
Phase zero has one goal and one exit.

2
00:00:02.838 --> 00:00:05.187
The goal is to produce
the planning artifacts

3
00:00:05.187 --> 00:00:07.475
and stand up the platform
that will hold them.

4
00:00:07.475 --> 00:00:11.378
The exit is gate G zero, Ready
to Plan: the platform works,

5
00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:15.975
the assessment is committed, and
no priority-one finding is open.

6
00:00:15.975 --> 00:00:17.138
Two cautions.

7
00:00:17.138 --> 00:00:22.299
Four weeks is illustrative, so plan from
the milestones, not the week count.

8
00:00:22.299 --> 00:00:27.225
And nothing moves before the assessment
is done; a plan without one is a guess.

9
00:00:27.225 --> 00:00:29.230
So what has to be true on day one?
